      "refersTo": "input-showroom",
      "description": "原生文本输入；展厅覆盖共享字段的底色与描边色。",
      "html": "<label class=\"ds-label\">稿件标题<input class=\"ds-input\" type=\"text\" value=\"我的工作室装修提案\" maxlength=\"80\"></label>",
      "css": ".ds-label{display:grid;gap:7px;font-family:\"Microsoft YaHei\",\"PingFang SC\",sans-serif;font-size:12px;font-weight:500;color:var(--ink,#293c30)}.ds-input{font-family:inherit;font-size:13px;width:100%;min-width:0;min-height:44px;padding:12px;border:1px solid var(--line,#c7c8ae);border-radius:8px;background:var(--paper,#fbf5e8);color:var(--ink,#293c30);caret-color:#365b43}.ds-input::placeholder{color:#66725b;font-size:13px}.ds-button:focus-visible,.ds-input:focus-visible,.ds-select:focus-visible,.ds-view:focus-visible,.ds-close:focus-visible{outline:3px solid #8c4d26;outline-offset:4px}@media(max-width:800px){.ds-input{font-size:16px}}"
    },
    {
      "name": "展厅原生选择框",
      "kind": "input",
      "refersTo": "input-showroom",
      "description": "界面皮肤选择；保持浏览器原生下拉行为和七变量覆盖范围。",
      "html": "<label class=\"ds-label\">界面皮肤<select class=\"ds-select\"><option>暖纸与森林绿</option><option>矿物白与深海蓝</option></select></label>",
      "css": ".ds-label{display:grid;gap:7px;font-family:\"Microsoft YaHei\",\"PingFang SC\",sans-serif;font-size:12px;font-weight:500;color:var(--ink,#293c30)}.ds-select{font-family:inherit;font-size:13px;width:100%;min-width:0;min-height:44px;padding:12px;border:1px solid var(--line,#c7c8ae);border-radius:8px;background:var(--paper,#fbf5e8);color:var(--ink,#293c30)}.ds-button:focus-visible,.ds-input:focus-visible,.ds-select:focus-visible,.ds-view:focus-visible,.ds-close:focus-visible{outline:3px solid #8c4d26;outline-offset:4px}@media(max-width:800px){.ds-select{font-size:16px}}"
    },
    {
      "name": "展厅镜头导航",
      "kind": "nav",
      "refersTo": "camera-choice",
      "description": "可换行的按钮导航；选中态由 aria-pressed 表示。",
      "html": "<nav class=\"ds-views\" aria-label=\"展厅镜头\"><button class=\"ds-view\" aria-pressed=\"true\">全景</button><button class=\"ds-view\" aria-pressed=\"false\">工作区</button><button class=\"ds-view\" aria-pressed=\"false\">二楼</button></nav>",
      "css": ".ds-views{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px}.ds-view{font-family:\"Microsoft YaHei\",\"PingFang SC\",sans-serif;font-size:12px;border:1px solid var(--line,#c7c8ae);border-radius:var(--radius,12px);padding:11px 17px;background:var(--paper,#fbf5e8);color:var(--ink,#293c30);cursor:pointer;min-height:44px;transition:background .15s;padding:9px 14px}.ds-view:hover{background:#e4e9d4}.ds-view[aria-pressed=true]{background:var(--accent,#365b43);color:#fff8e6;border-color:var(--accent,#365b43)}.ds-view:disabled{cursor:wait;opacity:.55}.ds-button:focus-visible,.ds-input:focus-visible,.ds-select:focus-visible,.ds-view:focus-visible,.ds-close:focus-visible{outline:3px solid #8c4d26;outline-offset:4px}@media(prefers-reduced-motion:reduce){.ds-button,.ds-view{transition:none!important}}@media(max-width:800px){.ds-views{gap:6px}.ds-view{padding:8px 13px}}"
    },
    {
      "name": "共享状态标签",
      "kind": "chip",
      "refersTo": "status-chip",
      "description": "静态状态文字；没有悬停、选中或筛选行为。",
      "html": "<span class=\"ds-status\">待编辑</span>",
      "css": ".ds-status{font-family:\"Microsoft YaHei\",\"PingFang SC\",sans-serif;font-size:11px;background:#e2e8d4;color:var(--ink,#293c30);padding:6px 9px;white-space:nowrap;border-radius:6px}"
    },
    {
      "name": "共享入口卡片",
      "kind": "card",
      "refersTo": "entry-card",
      "description": "共享主游戏入口的纸色卡片，楷体标题与局部柔和阴影；不是所有工具分组的容器模板。",
      "html": "<section class=\"ds-entry\"><h1 class=\"ds-entry-title\">把真实问题，做成真实作品</h1><p class=\"ds-entry-copy\">进入公司的三维工作空间。</p></section>",
      "css": ".ds-entry{font-family:\"Microsoft YaHei\",\"PingFang SC\",sans-serif;background:var(--paper,#fbf5e8);color:var(--ink,#293c30);padding:30px 34px;border-radius:16px;max-width:510px;box-shadow:0 16px 60px #463e2826}.ds-entry-title{margin:0;font-family:\"STKaiti\",\"KaiTi\",serif;font-size:34px;line-height:1.4;font-weight:600;letter-spacing:-.02em;text-wrap:balance}.ds-entry-copy{margin:14px 0 0;font-size:14px;line-height:1.9;color:#4e5c47}@media(max-width:700px){.ds-entry{padding:23px;max-width:100%}.ds-entry-title{font-size:27px}.ds-entry-copy{font-size:12px}}"
    },
    {
      "name": "共享弹窗表面",
      "kind": "custom",
      "refersTo": "dialog-panel",
      "description": "静态展示原生 dialog 的视觉表面；实际打开、关闭、聚焦由原生 dialog 与应用事件负责。",
      "html": "<section class=\"ds-dialog\" role=\"dialog\" aria-label=\"工作面板演示\"><div class=\"ds-panel-head\"><h2 class=\"ds-title\">工作面板 · 演示</h2><button class=\"ds-close\">关闭</button></div><p class=\"ds-intro\">通用写手角色 · 本人控制 · 待编辑。正式权限始终由主系统校验。</p></section>",
      "css": ".ds-dialog{font-family:\"Microsoft YaHei\",\"PingFang SC\",sans-serif;color:var(--ink,#293c30);border:0;border-radius:16px;background:var(--paper,#fbf5e8);padding:28px;max-width:660px;width:calc(100% - 40px);max-height:calc(100dvh - 64px);overflow:auto;box-shadow:0 22px 90px #242d2847}.ds-panel-head{display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;gap:20px;padding-bottom:18px}.ds-title{margin:0;font-size:24px;font-weight:600}.ds-close{font-family:inherit;border:0;border-radius:var(--radius,12px);background:#e8e9da;color:var(--ink,#293c30);font-size:12px;padding:8px 13px;min-height:44px;cursor:pointer;transition:background .15s}.ds-close:hover{background:#e8e9da}.ds-intro{margin:0 0 20px;font-size:13px;line-height:1.85;color:#58664f}.ds-button:focus-visible,.ds-input:focus-visible,.ds-select:focus-visible,.ds-view:focus-visible,.ds-close:focus-visible{outline:3px solid #8c4d26;outline-offset:4px}@media(max-width:700px){.ds-dialog{width:calc(100% - 24px);padding:21px;max-height:calc(100dvh - 24px)}.ds-title{font-size:21px}}@media(prefers-reduced-motion:reduce){.ds-close{transition:none!important}}"
    }
  ],
  "narrative": {
    "northStar": "暖阳木质工作室",
    "overview": "现有世界以木地板、鼠尾草绿墙面、木格窗和两层挑空总部建立亲近感。空间由 Three.js 原生几何、材质和真实灯光构成；纸色界面与森林绿操作控件延续室内的材料关系。\n\n工具界面采用清楚、克制的系统字体与单列控件。主游戏入口保留楷体标题；展厅工具标题使用系统无衬线字体。冷蓝对照主题沿用同一空间及交互锚点，改变建筑配色、光照和界面颜色。\n\n本文件是现有代码的提取记录。颜色、排版、圆角和组件常量见 frontmatter；未建立全局 token 的值如实标为观察值。页面编排与访客路径保存在 surface brief，不提升为全局设计规则。",
    "keyCharacteristics": [
      "暖纸与森林绿连接木质、鼠尾草绿的总部空间。",
      "真实三维几何与柔和投影提供深度，界面以平面分区为主。",
      "系统字体、原生表单控件、明确焦点与可读操作状态。",
      "矿物白与深海蓝作为同布局的冷色对照，保留现有主题覆盖边界。"
    ],
    "rules": [
      {
        "name": "The Theme Boundary Rule",
        "body": "界面主题仅替换 paper、ink、muted、accent、line、error、horizon 七个 CSS 变量。当前悬停色、焦点色、部分表单、提示、状态和文字色仍为硬编码；冷色主题并非完整语义换肤。新增界面优先复用已存在的变量，不把本次提取当作辅助色已全部 token 化的证据。",
        "section": "colors"
      }
    ],
    "dos": [
      "Do 以现有暖阳木质空间、暖纸界面和森林绿控件为默认视觉依据。",
      "Do 复用七个现有界面变量，并对照两套主题检查控件的实际状态。",
      "Do 保留系统字体、原生字段和可见的键盘焦点。",
      "Do 按共享 700px、展厅 800px 断点及粗指针条件复核相关界面。",
      "Do 从主题 JSON 与空间实现核对材质、光照和曝光，保留当前布局契约。"
    ],
    "donts": [
      "Don't 把冷蓝对照主题描述为新地图或完整的全组件换肤。",
      "Don't 将文档中合成的色带当作已实现的 CSS 颜色 scale。",
      "Don't 声称所有辅助色、间距与圆角都已统一为运行时 token。",
      "Don't 在提取文档时引入新字体、阴影、悬停动画或空间重设计。",
      "Don't 把视觉主题、演示状态或通用角色外观当作真实业务与权限来源。"
    ]
  }
}
